# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem
npm-debug.log*
# cloudflare-env.d.ts is intentionally committed (not ignored): it's pure type
# declarations (binding/var names -> types, no secret values), and Cloudflare's
# remote build does a fresh clone with no way to run `wrangler types` itself,
# so without this checked in, the build fails on every CloudflareEnv property.
DEVELOPER-NOTES.md
